    environment: "any (Abaddon)",
    visualDescription: "An ever-gnashing maw, filled with row after row of mismatched teeth, dominates this frightful creature’s orb-like body.",
    description: "The least of daemonkind, cacodaemons spawn from eddies of angry, violent, and demented souls amid the mists of Abaddon. Dim-witted but utterly evil, they endlessly seek to cause pain and indulge their hunger for mortal souls. Many more powerful fiends keep cacodaemons as pets, if only to be able to harvest the tiny creatures’ soul gems.",
